    Scheduler --> |strategy_type dispatch| Other[Intraday / Weekend Combo / OTM Put Roll engines]
    RS --> SEBI[compliance/sebi_rules.py]
    RS --> Factory[broker_factory.py]
    Factory --> Broker[PaperBroker / UpstoxBroker]
    Broker --> IC[utils/instrument_cache.py]
    IC --> API1[Upstox: Scrip Master]

    Scheduler --> Notify[utils/notify.py]
    Notify --> Bell[In-app Notification Bell]
    Notify --> TG[Telegram]

    RS --> Greeks[utils/black76.py — Greeks/IV]
    RS --> Payoff[utils/payoff.py — Max P/L, POP]
